{"availability":"available","full":"RooAGI/Lint-AI","name":"Lint-AI","description":"Persistent memory layer for AI coding agents — current-state retrieval that knows what is still true. Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":11,"forks":8,"created":"2026-04-05T18:48:23Z","updated":"2026-10-11T04:34:54Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://rooagi.github.io/Lint-AI/","topics":["agent-memory","agents","agy","agy-cli","ai-agent","ai-memory","claude","claude-code","codex","codex-cli","codex-plugin","gemini","gemini-ai","gemini-cli","llm-memory","long-term-memory","mcp","mcp-server","persistent-memory","rust"],"demo":"https://rooagi.github.io/Lint-AI/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:26.926Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:26.926Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:26.926Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:26.926Z","stars":11,"forks":8}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["AI memory that knows what is still true. Your agent doesn't just forget; it can confidently remember outdated decisions.","Lint-AI is an open-source persistent agent memory layer for Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Antigravity CLI (AGY), and Muse Code. It turns project history — sessions, documents, decisions, traces, notes, and code — into current, evidence-backed context when an agent needs it.","Search can find the right topic. Lint-AI helps an agent answer the harder question: is this information still true? It uses relevance, time, and semantic relationships to distinguish the latest truth from old-but-still-relevant history."],"features":["Relevance — is this about the question?","Recency — when was this evidence true?","Supersession — did something newer replace it?","Temporal intent — is the user asking about now, last Tuesday, or a historical state?","Evidence — where did the answer come from?"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RooAGI/Lint-A